    "operation": "Production React UMD, unchanged. Two nested ConfigProviders, public Menu items, controlled openKeys, forceSubMenuRender, motion=false and an explicit popup host. Record authored class tokens and CSS declarations on normal and grouped items, submenu titles/lists/icons and portal roots. Provider popup class uses shorthand; local style uses popup.root. A local item CSS value supersedes the shared slot. An empty inner menu record replaces the outer defaults."
